Cultivars
The following cultivars have received the Royal Horticultural Society's Award of Garden Merit:
'Blush' pink/red flowers, {{convert|2.5|m|ft|abbr=on}} 
'Bonfire' - pink/white flowers, {{convert|1|m|ft|abbr=on}} 
'Carnaval' red/pink leaves turning green edged white, white flowers, {{convert|1.5|m|ft|abbr=on}} 
'Cavatine' - white flowers, {{convert|0.5|m|ft|abbr=on}} 
'Debutante' - cream flowers, {{convert|1|m|ft|abbr=on}} 
'Firecrest' - foliage red to green, flowers pink {{convert|2.5|m|ft|abbr=on}} 
'Flaming Silver' - young red foliage turning green margined silver, {{convert|1.5 |m|ft|abbr=on}} 
'Mountain Fire' - red leaves turning green, white flowers {{convert|4|m|ft|abbr=on}} 
'Pink Delight' - foliage bronze to green, flowers pink to white, {{convert|1.5|m|ft|abbr=on}} 
'Prelude' - cream/white flowers, {{convert|1|m|ft|abbr=on}} 
'Purity' - white flowers, {{convert|1.5|m|ft|abbr=on}} 
'Sarabande' - white flowers, {{convert|2.5|m|ft|abbr=on}} 
'Valley Valentine' - red flowers, {{convert|2.5|m|ft|abbr=on}}
